1
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,940
Do as I say later.

2
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:36,010
Hit me harder.

3
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,910
Do you think Lu Ye will come to save you?

4
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,180
No one knows Lu Ye better than I do.

5
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,680
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 2]

6
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:53,210
Young Master.

7
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,240
Young Master.

8
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,100
Has Shen Tianbai really lost his memory?

9
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:57,830
I don't know.

10
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,290
He...

11
00:00:59,830 --> 00:01:01,010
has always been long‑suffering.

12
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:02,770
Why don't we just kill him?

13
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:03,750
That will settle it once and for all.

14
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,800
The old man's death
hasn't been fully investigated yet.

15
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,860
He is still useful.

16
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,090
Besides,

17
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:09,590
killing him this way

18
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:11,600
is letting him off too easily.

19
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:14,680
Should we continue the torture then?

20
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:16,660
Tomorrow,

21
00:01:17,810 --> 00:01:19,410
we'll play a different game.

22
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:23,690
[Lu Mansion]

23
00:01:39,539 --> 00:01:40,660
Why?

24
00:01:41,410 --> 00:01:44,210
You can't even stand for an hour?

25
00:01:50,690 --> 00:01:52,150
You're not fit to serve me.

26
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:53,090
Leave.

27
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:55,910
I can learn.

28
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,520
Young Master, be careful.

29
00:02:11,990 --> 00:02:13,390
Don't get yourself hurt.

30
00:02:19,250 --> 00:02:21,780
Do you really want
to stay by my side that much?

31
00:02:22,390 --> 00:02:23,190
Yes.

32
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:25,710
Why?

33
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:27,710
To repay your kindness?

34
00:02:28,010 --> 00:02:28,910
I don't need that.

35
00:02:28,910 --> 00:02:29,670
I'm scared.

36
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,560
You're the only person I know.

37
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:36,240
Don't send me away.

38
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:40,940
Officer Shen.

39
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:44,940
Shen Tianbai,

40
00:02:45,579 --> 00:02:47,040
what exactly are you up to?

41
00:02:48,090 --> 00:02:48,890
Forget it.

42
00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:10,080
This tastes awful.

43
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:11,600
This is for you.

44
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:13,940
You used to love peanut butter the most.

45
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:15,500
Lu Ye,

46
00:03:15,980 --> 00:03:17,260
you're testing me.

47
00:03:21,579 --> 00:03:22,650
In the past,

48
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:24,460
were we close?

49
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:27,920
Not really.

50
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:40,820
Is it good?

51
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:43,470
It's delicious.

52
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:04,240
You are severely allergic to peanuts.

53
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,640
Did you even forget that?

54
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:09,580
You...

55
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,020
lied to me.

56
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:15,420
I was bored,

57
00:04:15,990 --> 00:04:17,390
so I was just teasing you.

58
00:04:19,019 --> 00:04:20,500
You're about to die.

59
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:23,480
Still can't remember?

60
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:26,380
I really...

61
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:29,840
I really don't remember anything,

62
00:04:29,870 --> 00:04:30,670
Young Master.

63
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:55,180
Seems you don't want me to die.

64
00:04:58,940 --> 00:04:59,900
I believe you.

65
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:02,830
If you want to make a living by my side,

66
00:05:02,830 --> 00:05:04,430
loyalty alone is not enough.

67
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:07,520
You also have to be useful.

68
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:16,980
Kill him.

69
00:05:17,890 --> 00:05:18,810
Who is he?

70
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,560
Does it matter?

71
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,010
He's just a traitor.

72
00:05:23,940 --> 00:05:25,180
I almost forgot.

73
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:27,550
To Officer Shen,

74
00:05:27,580 --> 00:05:28,820
it is indeed very important.

75
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:32,340
After all, Officer Shen
is the savior of our Ningcheng.

76
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:34,870
How could he kill the innocent?

77
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:38,240
What about you,

78
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:39,940
Shen Tianbai?

79
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:43,180
Is right and wrong

80
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:45,659
just as important to you?

81
00:05:56,570 --> 00:05:58,290
It's time for you to taste

82
00:05:58,340 --> 00:06:00,580
what it's like to be trampled underfoot.

83
00:06:00,580 --> 00:06:01,580
It's Biao.

84
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:03,270
Lu Ye,

85
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:04,870
you still don't believe me.

86
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:08,020
A scumbag who collects
blood money at the docks

87
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:10,300
wouldn't be an innocent victim.

88
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:12,500
Young Master,

89
00:06:12,570 --> 00:06:13,700
you misunderstood.

90
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:17,180
I just wanted to know how he offended you.

91
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:17,980
That way...

92
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:26,700
I can find the most suitable way
for him to die.

93
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:29,940
Young Master,

94
00:06:31,060 --> 00:06:31,920
is that enough?

95
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:34,740
Come here.

96
00:06:36,060 --> 00:06:36,860
Yes.

97
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:54,680
You did such a good job.

98
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:05,060
You deserve a reward.

99
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:18,590
Hurry up and follow.

100
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,110
Damn it.

101
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:23,050
That unreliable guy, Biao,

102
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:25,260
was supposed to pick up
this batch of goods at Xingang.

103
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:26,060
Where is he?

104
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:28,680
He must have gone drinking again.

105
00:07:28,790 --> 00:07:29,860
Damn it, who is it?

106
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:31,470
Long time no see.

107
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:33,720
Young...

108
00:07:33,740 --> 00:07:34,659
Young Master.

109
00:07:40,659 --> 00:07:42,320
The Qingtian Gang has fallen.

110
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:44,320
I heard you've been having a hard time,

111
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,880
shining shoes for a few coppers.

112
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:48,780
But I don't need my shoes shined.

113
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:50,060
Get lost.

114
00:07:54,250 --> 00:07:55,070
I'm telling you,

115
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:56,020
get the hell out of here.

116
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:57,420
Don't get in the way of my business,

117
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:58,580
or I won't spare you.

118
00:07:59,020 --> 00:07:59,820
Business?

119
00:08:01,490 --> 00:08:04,770
You mean stealing my goods
to sell for money?

120
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:05,660
Your goods?

121
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,540
Nonsense!

122
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:07,860
Finders keepers.

123
00:08:08,220 --> 00:08:09,300
Don't run if you have the guts.

124
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:10,220
We'll talk when Biao gets here.

125
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:11,280
He's already here.

126
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,150
What?

127
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:21,300
You...

128
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,120
Freeze.

129
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:26,580
Officer Shen,

130
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:29,880
you're still highly skilled
even with amnesia.

131
00:08:31,220 --> 00:08:32,020
Make a choice:

132
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,340
the goods

133
00:08:34,620 --> 00:08:35,580
or your life?

134
00:08:36,380 --> 00:08:37,340
My life.

135
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:38,539
My life, Young Master.

136
00:08:38,539 --> 00:08:39,679
Young Master, please spare me.

137
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,809
I'll go get the goods for you right now.

138
00:08:50,820 --> 00:08:52,380
Lu Ye, prepare to die!

139
00:08:52,710 --> 00:08:54,110
Young Master, watch out!

140
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:01,740
Young Master,

141
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:02,780
are you okay?

142
00:09:09,780 --> 00:09:10,870
Shen Tianbai,

143
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:13,470
you actually took a stab for me.

144
00:09:20,150 --> 00:09:21,910
Water.

145
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,140
Water.

146
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:27,270
Open your mouth.

147
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,060
It's hot.

148
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,470
You're being picky.

149
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:37,910
Drink it or leave it.

150
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:44,220
Young Master.

151
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:55,900
Young Master, you're fine.

152
00:09:57,900 --> 00:09:59,060
Great.

153
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:03,170
You talk too much
for someone about to die.

154
00:10:03,170 --> 00:10:04,340
Save your words

155
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:06,630
for your journey to the afterlife.

156
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:19,780
Lu Ye,

157
00:10:21,070 --> 00:10:22,950
you still refuse to believe me.

158
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:32,900
Oh no.

159
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,180
But

160
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:38,760
as long as you're fine.

161
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:42,420
Young Master,

162
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:44,180
how could you risk your life

163
00:10:44,180 --> 00:10:45,640
just to test Shen Tianbai?

164
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:46,540
That driver is a madman—

165
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:47,580
Alright, Uncle Zhong.

166
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:48,500
Don't worry.

167
00:10:48,860 --> 00:10:49,980
I'm perfectly fine,

168
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,580
and I brought the goods back.

169
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:53,660
By the way,

170
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:55,380
at the police station,

171
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:57,920
I had an informant
check the autopsy report.

172
00:10:59,790 --> 00:11:01,620
Besides the shot from Shen Tianbai,

173
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:04,950
there was also a slow-acting poison
in the old chief's body.

174
00:11:06,780 --> 00:11:07,580
Poison?

175
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:12,580
Do you think this poison could also
be related to Shen Tianbai?

176
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:13,380
No.

177
00:11:15,060 --> 00:11:16,860
If Shen Tianbai wanted to kill someone,

178
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:18,130
he wouldn't hide it.

179
00:11:18,630 --> 00:11:21,290
He wouldn't stoop to
such underhanded methods.

180
00:11:22,890 --> 00:11:25,450
Besides the shot, there was poison.

181
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:29,060
You can guard against outsiders
day and night,

182
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,940
but it's hard
to guard against a thief within.

183
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:31,990
Are you saying

184
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:34,410
there's a mole in the Qingtian Gang?

185
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:42,860
How is the investigation
into Shen Tianbai going?

186
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:44,860
Shen Tianbai didn't disappear
for no reason.

187
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:46,920
He was kicked out of the police force.

188
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:48,140
What?

189
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:48,820
Who did it?

190
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:50,820
His master, Wu Ren.

191
00:11:52,430 --> 00:11:54,500
Shen Tianbai was cultivated
by Wu Ren himself.

192
00:11:54,500 --> 00:11:55,700
How is that possible?

193
00:11:56,860 --> 00:11:58,980
It's said that these years,

194
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,710
Shen Tianbai was too prominent

195
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:03,180
and blocked Wu Ren's path to promotion.

196
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:07,180
So Wu Ren wanted to take the opportunity
to get rid of Shen Tianbai.

197
00:12:07,180 --> 00:12:08,220
Moreover,

198
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:11,200
there was indeed a fire
at the train station that day,

199
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:13,350
which matches what Shen Tianbai said.

200
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:18,020
Shen Tianbai,

201
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:21,310
what exactly happened that night?

202
00:12:22,690 --> 00:12:24,330
Why did you fire that shot?

203
00:12:52,010 --> 00:12:54,140
Officer Shen, you're really capable.

204
00:12:54,180 --> 00:12:57,460
You can even thrive in your rival's house.

205
00:12:54,580 --> 00:12:57,690
[Hui, Shisha Gang]

206
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:00,820
Impressive, really.

207
00:13:01,180 --> 00:13:03,620
Hui, just speak your mind.

208
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,340
I heard

209
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:09,140
you helped Lu Ye steal
a shipment from Qinglong.

210
00:13:09,900 --> 00:13:10,900
Shen Tianbai,

211
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:15,820
you haven't forgotten why you
joined the Qingtian Gang, have you?

212
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:18,900
Of course.

213
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:22,980
There's a mole in the Qingtian Gang.

214
00:13:23,020 --> 00:13:24,140
Thanks to him,

215
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:27,030
your Shisha Gang
was able to get rid of Lu Wenbiao.

216
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:28,340
However,

217
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:30,140
when the deal was over,

218
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:33,180
even you didn't know
who this person really was.

219
00:13:33,340 --> 00:13:35,340
I joined the Qingtian Gang
for one purpose,

220
00:13:35,340 --> 00:13:36,700
which is to find the mole

221
00:13:37,060 --> 00:13:40,260
and kill him first.

222
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:42,460
Lu Ye wants to catch the mole.

223
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:43,580
So do I.

224
00:13:43,580 --> 00:13:46,340
At least, our goals are the same for now.

225
00:13:46,580 --> 00:13:48,100
To gain his trust,

226
00:13:48,290 --> 00:13:51,050
of course, I have to help him
get that shipment.

227
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:55,340
Very well.

228
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,780
As expected of you, Officer Shen.

229
00:14:01,340 --> 00:14:03,860
If it weren't for your good master,

230
00:14:01,900 --> 00:14:04,350
[Shen Tianbai Unaccounted‑For: Wu Ren,
Hero's Master, Takes Over Police Affairs]

231
00:14:04,260 --> 00:14:06,300
who would have thought

232
00:14:06,580 --> 00:14:08,980
we'd be buddies one day?

233
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:11,700
Master.

234
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:16,940
Is he even worthy?
